&lt;p&gt;Why Gmail Account History Matters&lt;br&gt;
Email history can provide useful context about the development and use of an account.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For personal users, an older inbox may contain years of conversations, receipts, photographs, documents, and important communications. For professionals, an established Gmail address may have been used for communication with clients, colleagues, services, and online platforms.&lt;/p&gt;

